mp;#x27;s headquarters in Montreal. Which of the following must Ethan necessarily be aware of in order to draft his conclusions and recommendations in the most effective manner?</mat_formattedtext></mat_extension></material></flow></flow><flow class="RESPONSE_BLOCK"><response_lid ident="response" rcardinality="Single" rtiming="No"><render_choice shuffle="No" minnumber="0" maxnumber="0"><flow_label class="Block"><response_label ident="D254821E680B45A0BD9401987ECDC53D" shuffle="Yes" rarea="Ellipse" rrange="Exact"><flow_mat class="FORMATTED_TEXT_BLOCK"><material><mat_extension><mat_formattedtext type="HTML">The median age of the audience</mat_formattedtext></mat_extension></material></flow_mat></response_label></flow_label><flow_label class="Block"><response_label ident="163255596BE0465490EAFA828AB26244" shuffle="Yes" rarea="Ellipse" rrange="Exact"><flow_mat class="FORMATTED_TEXT_BLOCK"><material><mat_extension><mat_formattedtext type="HTML">The geographic distribution of the audience</mat_formattedtext></mat_extension></material></flow_mat></response_label></flow_label><flow_label class="Block"><response_label ident="6390CFF9AEFC41E18D853F984E256EF6" shuffle="Yes" rarea="Ellipse" rrange="Exact"><flow_mat class="FORMATTED_TEXT_BLOCK"><material><mat_extension><mat_formattedtext type="HTML">The audience&amp;#x27;s level of understanding</mat_formattedtext></mat_extension></material></flow_mat></response_label></flow_label><flow_label class="Block"><response_label ident="2531D2DABFD34596A358C0730790EDE4" shuffle="Yes" rarea="Ellipse" rrange="Exact"><flow_mat class="FORMATTED_TEXT_BLOCK"><material><mat_extension><mat_formattedtext type="HTML">The male-to-female ratio of the audience</mat_formattedtext></mat_extension></material></flow_mat></response_label></flow_label></render_choice></response_lid></flow></flow></presentation><resprocessing scoremodel="SumOfScores"><outcomes><decvar varname="SCORE" vartype="Decimal" defaultval="0.0" minvalue="0.0" maxvalue="1.00"/></outco